The concept of this game is so interesting and novel that I had to buy it on princple. As long as the core features of the gameplay work (and they do, not considering display bugs), I do not care for how well this game operates. It is in early acess, after all.
If you like the concept, buy it or put it on your wishlist. And please, please spread the word about this game: there are only 15 people on the discord (
